<title>CANADA: Canada C$1.3 bln bond due 2027 yields 6.467 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada C$1.3 bln bond due 2027 yields 6.467 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Government of Canada said its C$1.3 billion auction of 8.0 percent bonds due June 1, 2027 produced the following results:</p>
<p>			     YIELD	 PRICE</p>
<p>		   AVG     6.467     120.141  PCT AT</p>
<p>		   LOW     6.455     120.324  HI YIELD</p>
<p>		   HIGH    6.480     119.943   59.85714</p>
<p>The bonds will be dated and delivered on August 1. The outstanding debt of the issue totals C$8.4 billion. Bids from primary dealers totalled C$2,873.45 million, including C$64.1 million non-competitive tenders at the average yield.</p>
<p>Proceeds will be used for general purposes.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
